          "content": {
            "mimeType": "application/json; charset=utf-8",
            "text": "{\"status\":1,\"data\":{\"widgets\":{\"37cb6d7b-26a7-4023-a783-eea200990058\":{\"status\":1,\"data\":{\"app\":\"event-calendar\",\"settings\":{\"events\":[{\"id\":\"cf4508d8-479a-4f03-9d64-0f0bc62f4f09\",\"name\":\"Sunday Movie Club - All Taprooms\",\"start\":{\"type\":\"datetime\",\"date\":\"2026-12-27\",\"time\":\"18:00\"},\"end\":{\"type\":\"datetime\",\"date\":\"2026-12-27\",\"time\":\"18:00\"},\"timeZone\":\"Europe/London\",\"repeatPeriod\":\"noRepeat\",\"repeatFrequency\":\"daily\",\"repeatInterval\":1,\"repeatWeeklyOnDays\":[\"su\"],\"repeatEnds\":\"never\",\"repeatEndsDate\":null,\"repeatEndsOccurrences\":1,\"repeatMonthlyOnDay\":\"sameDay\",\"exceptions\":[],\"description\":\"<div>Every Sunday we show a film at all taprooms from 6-8pm. Usual drinks and pizzas available, plus hot drinks and mulled wine.</div><br><div>This is what's showing:</div><br><div>Blackhorse Road: Romy &amp; Michele's High School Reunion</div><br><div>Forest Gate: What Women Want</div><br><div>Victoria Park: Kiss Kiss Bang Bang</div>\",\"images\":[],\"coverImage\":{\"url\":\"https://files.elfsightcdn.com/eafe4a4d-3436-495d-b748-5bdce62d911d/a3e9e469-703d-4753-bfae-f82b2bba5f22/alex-litvin-MAYsdoYpGuk-unsplash.jpg\",\"name\":\"alex-litvin-MAYsdoYpGuk-unsplash.jpg\",\"size\":3326764,\"type\":\"image/jpeg\",\"extension\":\"jpg\",\"width\":5472,\"height\":3648,\"meta\":{\"width\":5472,\"height\":3648}},\"eventType\":[],\"location\":[],\"host\":[],\"tags\":[{\"id\":\"53e2865d-0938-47e1-940d-9d54c3f7787f\",\"tagName\":\"Free\"}],\"color\":\"transparent\",\"actions\":[],\"actionsCaption\":\"\",\"video\":null,\"file\":null,\"isAllDay\":false},{\"id\":\"70413985-7c4b-40de-9e26-1770c9027bc7\",\"name\":\"Run Club - Blackhorse Road\",\"start\":{\"type\":\"datetime\",\"date\":\"2026-03-25\",\"time\":\"19:00\"},\"end\":{\"type\":\"datetime\",\"date\":\"2026-03-25\",\"time\":\"20:00\"},\"timeZone\":\"Europe/London\",\"repeatPeriod\":\"lastDayInMonth\",\"repeatFrequency\":\"monthly\",\"repeatInterval\":1,\"repeatEnds\":\"never\",\"repeatEndsDate\":null,\"repeatEndsOccurrences\":1,\"repeatMonthlyOnDay\":\"lastDay\",\"description\":\"<div>Every month we host a community Run Club. </div><br><div>It's open to all abilities, whether you've never run in your life or you smash out ultras. You're welcome to race ahead or walk the whole route.</div><br><div>It's typically a 5km round the local area and ends back at the taproopm for a pint on us.</div><br><div></div><br><div>Victoria Park = First Saturday of the month at 12pm</div><br><div>Blackhorse Road = Last Wednesday of the month at 7pm</div><br><div>Forest Gate = Last Saturday of the month at 12pm.</div><br><div></div>\",\"eventType\":[\"6a1c0e53-802b-4a6e-9a30-5689f90fc8cc\"],\"location\":[\"6ef80a92-4bfe-4fd6-bde2-b0fccda6bb7d\"],\"host\":[],\"tags\":[{\"id\":\"88cb177a-b3c9-430a-8108-5c2c5f853a85\",\"tagName\":\"Free\"},{\"id\":\"32a1dfaa-3ba7-49a4-b27d-451b3c9179f5\",\"tagName\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"b375c90d-3015-4cb4-84f6-b33eea7ed525\",\"tagName\":\"\"}],\"color\":\"rgb(209, 175, 255)\",\"video\":null,\"file\":null,\"repeatWeeklyOnDays\":[\"we\"],\"exceptions\":[],\"visible\":true,\"actions\":[],\"actionsCaption\":\"\",\"images\":[],\"coverImage\":{\"url\":\"https://files.elfsightcdn.com/eafe4a4d-3436-495d-b748-5bdce62d911d/cc131640-c2bf-446f-b626-f197c6e246f5/WhatsApp-Image-2024-08-28-at-20-05-02.jpg\",\"name\":\"WhatsApp Image 2024-08-28 at 20.05.02.jpeg\",\"size\":589215,\"type\":\"image/jpeg\",\"extension\":\"jpg\",\"width\":2048,\"height\":1536}},{\"id\":\"3138f385-309c-4278-8aea-aa6f27e561bc\",\"name\":\"Kids & Adults Fancy Dress Party & Halloween DJ Set\",\"start\":{\"type\":\"datetime\",\"date\":\"2026-10-30\",\"time\":\"16:00\"},\"end\":{\"type\":\"datetime\",\"date\":\"2026-10-30\",\"time\":\"23:00\"},\"timeZone\":\"Europe/London\",\"repeatPeriod\":\"noRepeat\",\"repeatFrequency\":\"daily\",\"repeatInterval\":1,\"repeatWeeklyOnDays\":[],\"repeatEnds\":\"never\",\"repeatEndsDate\":null,\"repeatEndsOccurrences\":1,\"repeatMonthlyOnDay\":\"sameDay\",\"exceptions\":[],\"description\":\"<div>Little monsters welcome from 4pm for a kids’ fancy dress party, with prizes for the best (and most inventive) costumes.</div><br><div>Once they’re tucked up, Nanna takes to the decks at 7pm alongside special guest Casper (the friendly ghost), spinning spooky records. Adults aren’t off the hook either - best dressed grown-up wins a £50 bar tab!</div>\",\"images\":[],\"coverImage\":{\"url\":\"https://files.elfsightcdn.com/eafe4a4d-3436-495d-b748-5bdce62d911d/6e9c5487-fcdb-4ab4-ad00-dbd6e0f713c6/nick-fewings-oPVNGh0hzdI-unsplash.jpg\",\"name\":\"nick-fewings-oPVNGh0hzdI-unsplash.jpg\",\"size\":1497680,\"type\":\"image/jpeg\",\"extension\":\"jpg\",\"width\":3032,\"height\":2022,\"meta\":{\"width\":3032,\"height\":2022}},\"eventType\":[\"68c11ec0-281a-4735-9862-06e09c717587\"],\"location\":[\"d4db9d7b-4c96-46e5-b884-81d94ce2c9f7\"],\"host\":[],\"tags\":[{\"id\":\"d3a2909f-75b5-41ba-a298-93fc79efd8a1\",\"tagName\":\"Free\"}],\"color\":\"rgb(15, 87, 28)\",\"actions\":[],\"actionsCaption\":\"\",\"video\":null,\"file\":null,\"isAllDay\":false},{\"id\":\"3405d9b7-de76-4d1a-b954-0c76fb8d81d8\",\"name\":\"Run Club - Forest Gate\",\"start\":{\"type\":\"datetime\",\"date\":\"2026-05-30\",\"time\":\"12:00\"},\"end\":{\"type\":\"datetime\",\"date\":\"2026-05-30\",\"time\":\"14:00\"},\"timeZone\":\"Europe/London\",\"repeatPeriod\":\"lastDayInMonth\",\"repeatFrequency\":\"monthly\",\"repeatInterval\":1,\"repeatEnds\":\"never\",\"repeatEndsDate\":null,\"repeatEndsOccurrences\":1,\"repeatMonthlyOnDay\":\"lastDay\",\"description\":\"<div>Every month we host a community Run Club. </div><br><div>It's open to all abilities, whether you've never run in your life or you smash out ultras. You're welcome to race ahead or walk the whole route.</div><br><div>It's typically a 5km round the local area and ends back at the taproopm for a pint on us.</div><br><div>Forest Gate = Last Saturday of the month at 12pm.</div><br><div>Victoria Park = First Saturday of the month at 12pm</div><br><div>Blackhorse Road = Last Wednesday of the month at 7pm</div><br><div></div><br><div></div>\",\"eventType\":[],\"location\":[\"d4db9d7b-4c96-46e5-b884-81d94ce2c9f7\"],\"host\":[],\"tags\":[{\"id\":\"88cb177a-b3c9-430a-8108-5c2c5f853a85\",\"tagName\":\"Free\"},{\"id\":\"32a1dfaa-3ba7-49a4-b27d-451b3c9179f5\",\"tagName\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"b375c90d-3015-4cb4-84f6-b33eea7ed525\",\"tagName\":\"\"}],\"color\":\"rgb(15, 87, 28)\",\"video\":null,\"file\":null,\"repeatWeeklyOnDays\":[\"we\"],\"exceptions\":[],\"visible\":true,\"actions\":[],\"actionsCaption\":\"\",\"images\":[],\"coverImage\":{\"url\":\"https://files.elfsightcdn.com/eafe4a4d-3436-495d-b748-5bdce62d911d/70de421f-12d4-4392-a7ec-89bf073225ac/PDBC_RunningClub_GetReadyTeaser.jpg\",\"name\":\"PDBC_RunningClub_GetReadyTeaser.jpg\",\"size\":258230,\"type\":\"image/jpeg\",\"extension\":\"jpg\",\"width\":1500,\"height\":1500,\"meta\":{\"width\":1500,\"height\":1500}}},{\"id\":\"3654bbd6-a895-42d2-b216-c083551eb3cb\",\"name\":\"Halloween Party\",\"start\":{\"type\":\"datetime\",\"date\":\"2026-10-31\",\"time\":\"19:00\"},\"end\":{\"type\":\"datetime\",\"date\":\"2026-10-31\",\"time\":\"23:00\"},\"timeZone\":\"Europe/London\",\"repeatPeriod\":\"noRepeat\",\"repeatFrequency\":\"daily\",\"repeatInterval\":1,\"repeatWeeklyOnDays\":[],\"repeatEnds\":\"never\",\"repeatEndsDate\":null,\"repeatEndsOccurrences\":1,\"repeatMonthlyOnDay\":\"sameDay\",\"exceptions\":[],\"description\":\"<div>Fancy dress, funky tunes and cocktails that go bump in the night! We’re pouring Pumpkin Spiced Espresso Martinis and Bloody Negronis at Viccy Park all evening, and the best costume bags a £50 bar tab. </div>\",\"images\":[],\"coverImage\":{\"url\":\"https://files.elfsightcdn.com/eafe4a4d-3436-495d-b748-5bdce62d911d/c31280d0-e613-4980-8536-92b9a5b81e4c/beth-teutschmann-ed5KySP1tfQ-unsplash.jpg\",\"name\":\"beth-teutschmann-ed5KySP1tfQ-unsplash.jpg\",\"size\":2171188,\"type\":\"image/jpeg\",\"extension\":\"jpg\",\"width\":4896,\"height\":2754,\"meta\":{\"width\":4896,\"height\":2754}},\"eventType\":[\"c69f13eb-2f51-44ee-9f82-a1f24a3d0472\"],\"location\":[\"51079595-090b-4b24-a4d3-a7b4b1330217\"],\"host\":[],\"tags\":[{\"id\":\"b329355b-fac8-453f-bb74-47a6613189a5\",\"tagName\":\"Free\"}],\"color\":\"rgb(6, 139, 136)\",\"actions\":[],\"actionsCaption\":\"\",\"video\":null,\"file\":null,\"isAllDay\":false},{\"id\":\"f1a44268-b734-4bf0-beef-cd236d70ec8f\",\"name\":\"Where My Ghouls At?! - Halloween Party at the Brewery\",\"start\":{\"type\":\"datetime\",\"date\":\"2026-10-31\",\"time\":\"19:00\"},\"end\":{\"type\":\"datetime\",\"date\":\"2026-10-31\",\"time\":\"23:00\"},\"timeZone\":\"Europe/London\",\"repeatPeriod\":\"noRepeat\",\"repeatFrequency\":\"daily\",\"repeatInterval\":1,\"repeatWeeklyOnDays\":[],\"repeatEnds\":\"never\",\"repeatEndsDate\":null,\"repeatEndsOccurrences\":1,\"repeatMonthlyOnDay\":\"sameDay\",\"exceptions\":[],\"description\":\"<div>Grab your ghoulfriends and head to the brewery for Halloween. As well as the usual beer line-up, there’ll be Devil’s Margaritas, Syringe Shots and other suitably spooky drinks, plus pizza from It’s Not Big Dough. Best costume bags a £50 bar tab, so no lazy cat ears.</div>\",\"images\":[],\"coverImage\":{\"url\":\"https://files.elfsightcdn.com/eafe4a4d-3436-495d-b748-5bdce62d911d/74850235-fc09-4d66-80d1-ddc11028c021/quilia-A59lWOrZVnw-unsplash.jpg\",\"name\":\"quilia-A59lWOrZVnw-unsplash.jpg\",\"size\":3682911,\"type\":\"image/jpeg\",\"extension\":\"jpg\",\"width\":4896,\"height\":3264,\"meta\":{\"width\":4896,\"height\":3264}},\"eventType\":[\"6a1c0e53-802b-4a6e-9a30-5689f90fc8cc\"],\"location\":[\"6ef80a92-4bfe-4fd6-bde2-b0fccda6bb7d\"],\"host\":[],\"tags\":[{\"id\":\"e31203e5-8c09-408b-918f-40ee5509e921\",\"tagName\":\"Free\"}],\"color\":\"rgb(209, 175, 255)\",\"actions\":[],\"actionsCaption\":\"\",\"video\":null,\"file\":null,\"isAllDay\":false},{\"id\":\"f7b862dc-3049-42e5-9bd3-3832856b9a83\",\"name\":\"Sunday Movie Club - All Taprooms\",\"start\":{\"type\":\"datetime\",\"date\":\"2026-11-01\",\"time\":\"18:00\"},\"end\":{\"type\":\"datetime\",\"date\":\"2026-11-01\",\"time\":\"20:00\"},\"timeZone\":\"Europe/London\",\"repeatPeriod\":\"noRepeat\",\"repeatFrequency\":\"daily\",\"repeatInterval\":1,\"repeatWeeklyOnDays\":[\"su\"],\"repeatEnds\":\"never\",\"repeatEndsDate\":null,\"repeatEndsOccurrences\":1,\"repeatMonthlyOnDay\":\"sameDay\",\"exceptions\":[],\"description\":\"<div>Sunday Movie Club is back, and so is the mulled wine. From 1 November, every Sunday is for films, blankets and putting off Monday for as long as possible. We’re starting with Halloween hangover viewing:</div><br><div>Blackhorse Road: Practical Magic<br>Forest Gate: Beetlejuice<br>Victoria Park: The Rocky Horror Picture Show</div>\",\"images\":[],\"coverImage\":{\"url\":\"https://files.elfsightcdn.com/eafe4a4d-3436-495d-b748-5bdce62d911d/a3e9e469-703d-4753-bfae-f82b2bba5f22/alex-litvin-MAYsdoYpGuk-unsplash.jpg\",\"name\":\"alex-litvin-MAYsdoYpGuk-unsplash.jpg\",\"size\":3326764,\"type\":\"image/jpeg\",\"extension\":\"jpg\",\"width\":5472,\"height\":3648,\"meta\":{\"width\":5472,\"height\":3648}},\"eventType\":[],\"location\":[],\"host\":[],\"tags\":[{\"id\":\"53e2865d-0938-47e1-940d-9d54c3f7787f\",\"tagName\":\"Free\"}],\"color\":\"transparent\",\"actions\":[],\"actionsCaption\":\"\",\"video\":null,\"file\":null,\"isAllDay\":false},{\"id\":\"e2142266-7400-4ad6-9ca3-d6e86e01cf83\",\"name\":\"Run Club - Victoria Park\",\"start\":{\"type\":\"datetime\",\"date\":\"2026-06-06\",\"time\":\"12:00\"},\"end\":{\"type\":\"datetime\",\"date\":\"2026-06-06\",\"time\":\"14:00\"},\"timeZone\":\"Europe/London\",\"repeatPeriod\":\"nthDayInMonth\",\"repeatFrequency\":\"monthly\",\"repeatInterval\":1,\"repeatEnds\":\"never\",\"repeatEndsDate\":null,\"repeatEndsOccurrences\":1,\"repeatMonthlyOnDay\":\"lastDay\",\"description\":\"<div>Every month we host a community Run Club. </div><br><div>It's open to all abilities, whether you've never run in your life or you smash out ultras. You're welcome to race ahead or walk the whole route.</div><br><div>It's typically a 5km round the local area and ends back at the taproopm for a pint on us.</div><br><div>Victoria Park = First Saturday of the month at 12pm</div><br><div>Forest Gate = Last Saturday of the month at 12pm.</div><br><div>Blackhorse Road = Last Wednesday of the month at 7pm</div><br><div></div><br><div></div>\",\"eventType\":[\"c69f13eb-2f51-44ee-9f82-a1f24a3d0472\"],\"location\":[\"51079595-090b-4b24-a4d3-a7b4b1330217\"],\"host\":[],\"tags\":[{\"id\":\"88cb177a-b3c9-430a-8108-5c2c5f853a85\",\"tagName\":\"Free\"},{\"id\":\"32a1dfaa-3ba7-49a4-b27d-451b3c9179f5\",\"tagName\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"b375c90d-3015-4cb4-84f6-b33eea7ed525\",\"tagName\":\"\"}],\"color\":\"rgb(6, 139, 136)\",\"video\":null,\"file\":null,\"repeatWeeklyOnDays\":[\"we\"],\"exceptions\":[],\"visible\":true,\"actions\":[],\"actionsCaption\":\"\",\"images\":[],\"coverImage\":{\"url\":\"https://files.elfsightcdn.com/eafe4a4d-3436-495d-b748-5bdce62d911d/cbb5af2f-1d00-4666-b4f4-6285637b5752/pretty_decent_vp_runi-jamesdpoole-9.jpg\",\"name\":\"pretty_decent_vp_runi@jamesdpoole-9.jpg\",\"size\":737218,\"type\":\"image/jpeg\",\"extension\":\"jpg\",\"width\":4000,\"height\":2667,\"meta\":{\"width\":4000,\"height\":2667}}},{\"id\":\"68fa8783-0cbf-4f3b-87d3-8308a36ecb69\",\"name\":\"Sunday Movie Club - All Taprooms\",\"start\":{\"type\":\"datetime\",\"date\":\"2026-11-08\",\"time\":\"18:00\"},\"end\":{\"type\":\"datetime\",\"date\":\"2026-11-08\",\"time\":\"20:00\"},\"timeZone\":\"Europe/London\",\"repeatPeriod\":\"noRepeat\",\"repeatFrequency\":\"daily\",\"repeatInterval\":1,\"repeatWeeklyOnDays\":[\"su\"],\"repeatEnds\":\"never\",\"repeatEndsDate\":null,\"repeatEndsOccurrences\":1,\"repeatMonthlyOnDay\":\"sameDay\",\"exceptions\":[],\"description\":\"<div>Every Sunday we show a film at all taprooms from 6-8pm. Usual drinks and pizzas available, plus hot drinks and mulled wine.</div><br><div>This is what's showing 8th Nov:</div><br><div>Blackhorse Road: Bring It On</div><br><div>Forest Gate: The Mask</div><br><div>Victoria Park: Labyrinth</div>\",\"images\":[],\"coverImage\":{\"url\":\"https://files.elfsightcdn.com/eafe4a4d-3436-495d-b748-5bdce62d911d/a3e9e469-703d-4753-bfae-f82b2bba5f22/alex-litvin-MAYsdoYpGuk-unsplash.jpg\",\"name\":\"alex-litvin-MAYsdoYpGuk-unsplash.jpg\",\"size\":3326764,\"type\":\"image/jpeg\",\"extension\":\"jpg\",\"width\":5472,\"height\":3648,\"meta\":{\"width\":5472,\"height\":3648}},\"eventType\":[],\"location\":[],\"host\":[],\"tags\":[{\"id\":\"53e2865d-0938-47e1-940d-9d54c3f7787f\",\"tagName\":\"Free\"}],\"color\":\"transparent\",\"actions\":[],\"actionsCaption\":\"\",\"video\":null,\"file\":null,\"isAllDay\":false},{\"id\":\"b05f6267-2505-4a19-9ab2-beb3e323f1d3\",\"name\":\"Sunday Movie Club - All Taprooms\",\"start\":{\"type\":\"datetime\",\"date\":\"2026-11-15\",\"time\":\"18:00\"},\"end\":{\"type\":\"datetime\",\"date\":\"2026-11-15\",\"time\":\"20:00\"},\"timeZone\":\"Europe/London\",\"repeatPeriod\":\"noRepeat\",\"repeatFrequency\":\"daily\",\"repeatInterval\":1,\"repeatWeeklyOnDays\":[\"su\"],\"repeatEnds\":\"never\",\"repeatEndsDate\":null,\"repeatEndsOccurrences\":1,\"repeatMonthlyOnDay\":\"sameDay\",\"exceptions\":[],\"description\":\"<div>Every Sunday we show a film at all taprooms from 6-8pm. Usual drinks and pizzas available, plus hot drinks and mulled wine.</div><br><div>This is what's showing:</div><br><div>Blackhorse Road: Almost Famous</div><br><div>Forest Gate: Zoolander</div><br><div>Victoria Park: Dirty Dancing</div>\",\"images\":[],\"coverImage\":{\"url\":\"https://files.elfsightcdn.com/eafe4a4d-3436-495d-b748-5bdce62d911d/a3e9e469-703d-4753-bfae-f82b2bba5f22/alex-litvin-MAYsdoYpGuk-unsplash.jpg\",\"name\":\"alex-litvin-MAYsdoYpGuk-unsplash.jpg\",\"size\":3326764,\"type\":\"image/jpeg\",\"extension\":\"jpg\",\"width\":5472,\"height\"