(ish) run setting off from the taproom around 7pm and finishing back there for a free pint.</div><br><div>All abilities welcome, even if you're a newbie!</div><br><div>Bag drop available.</div>\",\"eventType\":[\"6a1c0e53-802b-4a6e-9a30-5689f90fc8cc\"],\"location\":[\"6ef80a92-4bfe-4fd6-bde2-b0fccda6bb7d\"],\"host\":[],\"tags\":[{\"id\":\"e49805f9-ab26-4cef-9969-182b8d07c9cd\",\"tagName\":\"Free entry\"}],\"color\":\"transparent\",\"video\":null,\"file\":null,\"repeatWeeklyOnDays\":[\"we\"],\"exceptions\":[],\"actions\":[],\"actionsCaption\":\"\",\"images\":[],\"coverImage\":{\"url\":\"https://files.elfsightcdn.com/eafe4a4d-3436-495d-b748-5bdce62d911d/41721a8e-710b-43f5-9cc5-cac1168d7f0c/PDBC_RunningClub-SQ.jpg\",\"name\":\"PDBC_RunningClub-SQ.jpg\",\"size\":468627,\"type\":\"image/jpeg\",\"extension\":\"jpg\",\"width\":2000,\"height\":2000}},{\"id\":\"6d728f3c-ff5d-4608-abe5-734505a259c4\",\"name\":\"Climb Club\",\"start\":{\"type\":\"datetime\",\"date\":\"2025-09-17\",\"time\":\"18:00\"},\"end\":{\"type\":\"datetime\",\"date\":\"2025-09-17\",\"time\":\"20:30\"},\"timeZone\":\"Europe/London\",\"repeatPeriod\":\"custom\",\"repeatFrequency\":\"monthly\",\"repeatInterval\":1,\"repeatEnds\":\"onDate\",\"repeatEndsDate\":{\"type\":\"datetime\",\"date\":\"2025-11-26\",\"time\":\"18:00\"},\"repeatEndsOccurrences\":1,\"repeatMonthlyOnDay\":\"nthDay\",\"description\":\"<div><span>On the third Wednesday of every month we host a Climb Club with our friends at Mile End Climbing Wall.</span></div><br><div></div><br><div><span>We meet at the wall at 6pm for a relaxed, all abilities welcome, climb before heading back to our Viccy park taproom for a pint.   </span></div><br><div>Ticket includes entry and shoe hire.</div>\",\"eventType\":[\"c69f13eb-2f51-44ee-9f82-a1f24a3d0472\"],\"location\":[\"51079595-090b-4b24-a4d3-a7b4b1330217\"],\"host\":[],\"tags\":[{\"id\":\"82f67f17-01c8-4b98-bd12-519745e806c4\",\"tagName\":\"£20pp\"}],\"color\":\"transparent\",\"video\":null,\"file\":null